{"slug":"ayakiku-shuzo-ayagawa","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://sanuki-sake.com/%E7%B6%BE%E8%8F%8A%E9%85%92%E9%80%A0%E6%A0%AA%E5%BC%8F%E4%BC%9A%E7%A4%BE/","type":"institutional-directory","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","contact"]},{"url":"https://www.ayakiku.com/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["producer-activity","link-ownership"]}],"notes":"Identidad y municipio los fija la ficha del gremio, no la lectura de la web: una primera lectura devolvio otra razon social ('淡路菊水酒造') y otro municipio (Takamatsu Shione). Codigo postal 761-2204, numero 3393-1 y telefono 087-878-2222 coinciden en ambas, asi que era ruido de lectura y no un cruce de empresas. Tienda online sin confirmar."}
{"slug":"yushin-shuzo-ayagawa","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"http://www.yushin-brewer.com/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity"]}],"notes":"Fundada en 1854; hoy su negocio principal es la cosmetica de extracto de arroz (Rice Power) y su tienda ricepowershop.jp vende cosmetica, no sake. Sigue declarando elaboracion de sake artesanal y es socia del gremio, asi que entra como Sake, pero la venta online de bebida no esta comprobada."}
{"slug":"nishino-kinryo-kotohira","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://www.nishino-kinryo.co.jp/company/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity","contact"]},{"url":"https://www.nishino-kinryo.co.jp/store/","type":"official-store","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["online-sales"]}],"notes":"Elabora en Kotohira desde 1789 (sociedad constituida en 1918) y surte el sake ritual del santuario de Konpira."}
{"slug":"kawatsuru-shuzo-kanonji","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://kawatsuru.com/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity"]},{"url":"https://kawatsuru.com/shop/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["online-sales"]}],"notes":"Fundada en 1891 en Kanonji. La pagina /shop/ es un localizador de tiendas fisicas, no una tienda con carrito: no sostiene Venta online = si. La web no publica direccion ni telefono."}
{"slug":"maruo-honten-kotohira","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://sanuki-sake.com/%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E4%BC%9A%E7%A4%BE-%E4%B8%B8%E5%B0%BE%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%97/","type":"institutional-directory","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","contact"]}],"notes":"Bodega de 1885, marca Yorokobi Gaijin, muy conocida entre importadores. El gremio la lista sin dominio y no se localizo web propia: se queda en parcial y sin enlace externo hasta encontrarla."}
{"slug":"yamaroku-shoyu-shodoshima","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://yama-roku.net/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity"]},{"url":"https://shima-shoyu.com/","type":"institutional-directory","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity"]},{"url":"https://www.fperi.com/article/view/71","type":"press","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["contact","location"]}],"notes":"Fermenta en barricas de cedro centenarias y forma toneleros para otros obradores. Su web no publica carrito ni enlace a tienda: venta online sin comprobar pese a su distribucion internacional."}
