{"slug":"kinryo-shoyu-shodoshima","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://kinryo-shoyu.co.jp/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity","contact","online-sales"]}],"notes":"Razon social 金両株式会社. Almacen de fermentacion centenario declarado bien cultural registrado. La direccion de su web (Umaki-ko 842-1) corrige a la del articulo de prensa, que omitia el barrio."}
{"slug":"takahashi-shoten-shodoshima","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://www.shodoshima-yamamo.com/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","producer-activity","contact"]},{"url":"https://takahashisyoten.shop-pro.jp/","type":"official-store","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["online-sales"]},{"url":"https://www.fperi.com/article/view/71","type":"press","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["municipality","location"]}],"notes":"Fundada en 1852, marca Yamamo. Elabora una salsa de soja de haba poco habitual ademas de miso y aceite de oliva."}
