{"slug":"sakai-shoyu-kogyo-shodoshima","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"http://sakai-syouyu.info/","type":"official-site","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality","producer-activity","contact"]}],"notes":"El dominio que da la prensa (sakaishoyu.web.fc2.com) es hoy un aviso de mudanza que redirige a sakai-syouyu.info: se recoge el nuevo. La web propia da Nawa-ko 2125 y el articulo decia 2128; manda la web. Pedidos por formulario y fax, sin carrito."}
{"slug":"yamahisa-shodoshima","action":"keep","sources":[{"url":"https://shima-shoyu.com/","type":"institutional-directory","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["identity","municipality"]},{"url":"https://www.fperi.com/article/view/71","type":"press","checkedAt":"2026-08-04","claims":["contact","location"]}],"notes":"Su dominio devuelve 403 incluso con user-agent de navegador, pero sirve cuerpo: es un WAF, no un sitio muerto. Sin lectura de la ficha propia no se puede sostener verificado -> parcial."}
